    "scenesThatPass": [
      "LISA: She's like a goddamn poster child for high school.\nDIANE: Morning, sunshine. Remember, these are the best days of your life.\nDIANE: -- so far!\nLISA: If I wasn't such a lady, I'd tell you what a bitch she really is.",
      "LISA: Outta my way, fag. I'm up.\nLISA: This really should have been my year. I had a lotta work done - I-I mean, y'know, I'd done a lotta work over the summer.\nDIANE: Lisa?... Is-is that you?\nLISA: I lost a little weight.",
      "LISA: She got life without parole, so Kansas lives with her grandparents.\nLISA: Then there's Lucy...\nLISA: Geek extraordinaire - a walking left brain. She's supposed to have this genius I.Q.?\nLISA: Truth is, she's an obsessive-compulsive little freak.",
      "HANNAH: I-I didn't mean to say \"whore,\" Diane. I just hear it so much at church - it kinda came flying out of my head.\nDIANE: I know, Hannah. Look, I'm not going to get an abortion. I mean, I always planned to get married and have kids - I'm just going a little out …\nDIANE: Madonna.\nKANSAS: We're here for you, Diane.",
      "LUCY: Oh my G-d, you've been robbed!\nDIANE: No...I've been pregnant.\nCLEO: Di, are you okay? We can skip the girl party this week.\nDIANE: Everything's fine. I'm just having a little trouble keeping my frown upside down."
    ]
  },
